{"parse": {"title": "风暴前夜-04", "pageid": 128095, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%A3%8E%E6%9A%B4%E5%89%8D%E5%A4%9C-03\" title=\"风暴前夜-03\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">风暴前夜-04</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%A3%8E%E6%9A%B4%E5%89%8D%E5%A4%9C-05\" title=\"风暴前夜-05\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">风暴前夜</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">04</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.AF.94.E9.93.A0.E7.94.B2.E5.9D.9A.E5.9B.BA\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"比铠甲坚固\">比铠甲坚固</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 比铠甲坚固</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Harder than Armor</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-muwumenwai_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"muwumenwai_ye\"><img alt=\"muwumenwai_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/Cg-muwumenwai_ye.png/600px-Cg-muwumenwai_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/Cg-muwumenwai_ye.png/900px-Cg-muwumenwai_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/Cg-muwumenwai_ye.png/1200px-Cg-muwumenwai_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/82/HeadIconSmall-612901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/82/HeadIconSmall-612901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/82/HeadIconSmall-612901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">农户：</div><div>砰——当时子弹就离我的脑袋这么近。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/82/HeadIconSmall-612901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/82/HeadIconSmall-612901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/82/HeadIconSmall-612901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">农户：</div><div>我肯定它已经碰到了我的鼻子，但跳开了，就像我的鼻子是岩石和铁做的一样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格里高利：</div><div>老人家，我肯定你的鼻子不是铁做的，因为它和我的一样歪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/82/HeadIconSmall-612901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/82/HeadIconSmall-612901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/82/HeadIconSmall-612901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">农户：</div><div>年轻人，你多打几场仗就明白了，你的枪多快都没有用，能活下来，全靠天主的怜悯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>两匹战马都在院子里吃草，院子的主人遵循着哥萨克的传统，为路过的客人慷慨地奉上了草料和水。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/82/HeadIconSmall-612901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/82/HeadIconSmall-612901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/82/HeadIconSmall-612901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">农户：</div><div>军官老爷，您的水。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>谢谢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>您以前打过很多仗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/82/HeadIconSmall-612901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/82/HeadIconSmall-612901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/82/HeadIconSmall-612901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">农户：</div><div>哥萨克嘛，上马打仗，下马割麦子……这马真漂亮，只有军官老爷有这么漂亮的马。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/82/HeadIconSmall-612901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/82/HeadIconSmall-612901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/82/HeadIconSmall-612901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">农户：</div><div>我只有一匹大青马，瘸了腿，我自己打的，怕它被皇帝收去打仗了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/82/HeadIconSmall-612901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/82/HeadIconSmall-612901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/82/HeadIconSmall-612901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">农户：</div><div>原来也是一匹好马。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>您很会照看马。院子里的草都很好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格里高利：</div><div>谢谢您的水和草料，老人家。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/82/HeadIconSmall-612901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/82/HeadIconSmall-612901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/82/HeadIconSmall-612901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">农户：</div><div>不用感谢我，只要感谢仁慈的天主留下了你们的命，并且指引你们在这个晚上路过我的房子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/82/HeadIconSmall-612901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/82/HeadIconSmall-612901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/82/HeadIconSmall-612901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">农户：</div><div>年轻人，拿着这个避战符，把它缝进衣领里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>农户把长满茧子的干枯的手放在格里高利的头顶，士兵轻轻低下头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/82/HeadIconSmall-612901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/82/HeadIconSmall-612901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/82/HeadIconSmall-612901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">农户：</div><div>黄金的盾牌会保佑上帝的奴仆，你的意志会比铁还要硬，你的身体会比铠甲还要坚固。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/82/HeadIconSmall-612901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/82/HeadIconSmall-612901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/82/HeadIconSmall-612901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">农户：</div><div>枪子儿碰到你也会跳开。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格里高利：</div><div>我更愿意枪子儿找不到我，老人家。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_3_bg_01.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_3_bg_01\"><img alt=\"3_3_bg_01\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/Cg-3_3_bg_01.png/600px-Cg-3_3_bg_01.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/Cg-3_3_bg_01.png/900px-Cg-3_3_bg_01.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/Cg-3_3_bg_01.png/1200px-Cg-3_3_bg_01.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>你相信上帝吗，中士？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>白马稍稍落后了一个身位，他的主人正把避战符系在胸前的十字架上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>士兵愣了一下，露出一个羞赧的笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格里高利：</div><div>我不知道，将军，十字架是祖母给我的，她也会把符咒缝在我和父亲的衣领里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>说不定真的有用。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格里高利：</div><div>将军的军服里也缝着这个吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>当然，我祖母是个虔诚的教徒，以前她会把符咒缝在我和父亲的衬衫口袋里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>她说就是因为这个小小的纸片，我父亲才从斯大林格勒的战场上回来了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>而我才在一次次打光子弹以后，活了下来。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_0_bg_wurenqu1\"><img alt=\"3_0_bg_wurenqu1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu1.png/600px-Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu1.png/900px-Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu1.png/1200px-Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿尔蒙塔尔的高地上只有一个人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>子弹打光了，伊戈尔握着马刀。马刀也已经卷刃，薄薄的刀锋上长满蜷曲的锯齿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他脚下堆满了人，没有露出一块土地，就好像这本来就是尸体长成的山坡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">通讯器：</div><div>“增援已经到了，即刻开始反攻。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>将军没有立刻回答。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伊戈尔抬头看天空，有黑影在头顶盘旋，不是飞机，是一只秃鹫。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它在等着高地上最后一个人倒下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"532002.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-532002.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-532002.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"532002.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-532002.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-532002.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-532002.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-532002.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>我没有看见增援。我只看见士兵的尸体。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">通讯器：</div><div>“第九师需要即刻开始反攻。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">通讯器：</div><div>“我们对您的军队，对每一位士兵的牺牲致以崇高的敬意。<br />“这场战役过后，您会被授予上将军衔。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">通讯器：</div><div>“但我们需要您坚守到最后一刻。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"532002.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-532002.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-532002.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"532002.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-532002.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-532002.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-532002.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-532002.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>我只有一个问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"532002.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-532002.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-532002.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"532002.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-532002.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-532002.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-532002.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-532002.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>这座城市到底有什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">通讯器：</div><div>“很遗憾，我们无法向每一位战士解释战斗的目的。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">通讯器：</div><div>“但请您相信，您的军队流下的每一滴血，都会通往一个和平的、秩序的世界。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">通讯器：</div><div>“所有牺牲都是有意义的，只是，现在不是揭露一切的时机。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"532002.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-532002.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-532002.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"532002.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-532002.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-532002.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-532002.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-532002.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>这座城市到底有什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>对面传来的沉默像是一阵叹息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">通讯器：</div><div>“您暂时没有权限查看行动目的，少将。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"532002.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-532002.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-532002.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"532002.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-532002.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-532002.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-532002.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-532002.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>我的军队会坚守到最后一刻，像以前一样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"532002.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-532002.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-532002.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"532002.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-532002.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-532002.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-532002.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-532002.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>但我要知道我们究竟是为何而战，在此之前，我不会接受任何军衔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伊戈尔走下高地，走向街巷。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_0_bg_wurenqu2\"><img alt=\"3_0_bg_wurenqu2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png/600px-Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png/900px-Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png/1200px-Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>鲜血向下流去，像春天的小溪。空弹壳在他脚下发出沙沙声，像秋天的叶子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>以前父亲在树林里教他用马刀，桦树叶子就是这样在他脚下沙沙作响。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">瓦西里：</div><div><i>“近战的时候，马刀比枪更快。”</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">瓦西里：</div><div><i>“握住它，感受它的重心，不要有多余的动作，刀会告诉你，只有那一个瞬间。”</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>就是现在。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伊戈尔反手握刀，在敌军身上划出一道凛冽的圆弧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>戴着面具的士兵重重地倒在地上，从腹腔的裂口里流出黑色的黏液。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">敌方士兵：</div><div>——!!</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伊戈尔匪夷所思地闪现到另一名敌兵身后，用马刀刺穿了他的后背。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这是伊戈尔的神秘术，他利用冥界穿梭，并将死亡送到了敌人身边。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">瓦西里：</div><div><i>“在战场不仅要留意人，还要留意听炮弹的声音。当它的声音很长，那离你还很远。”</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">瓦西里：</div><div><i>“如果你听到一种低沉的、着急的‘噗噗’声，那它就在你头顶。”</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伊戈尔听到了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"532002.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-532002.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-532002.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"532002.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-532002.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-532002.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-532002.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-532002.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>卧倒——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>炮弹打在银行大楼门口。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>喜欢洗热水澡的一团长就站在那儿，张着嘴巴，脸上露出大惑不解的神情。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>直到烟尘和石块盖住了他的脸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">瓦西里：</div><div><i>“战争要取得胜利，军队必须像一个人。”</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">瓦西里：</div><div><i>“每一个细胞都要忠实地贯彻命令，军队才能活下来。”</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">瓦西里：</div><div><i>“在斯大林格勒，我用手下300个士兵把战线向前推了300米。”</i></div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_0_bg_wurenqu1\"><img alt=\"3_0_bg_wurenqu1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu1.png/600px-Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu1.png/900px-Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu1.png/1200px-Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>每一米战线都被尸体填满了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>每一张脸伊戈尔都认得，不管是生者，还是死者。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一营的尼古拉趴在地上，没了军帽。他的天灵盖被炮弹掀开，半个脑壳里装着黑色黏液，似乎有生命一样蠕动着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>今年才入伍的卡里莫夫，身体融化在不知名的神秘术里，年轻的蓝眼睛流到了鼻子下面，从肚子里长出来的手指还紧紧地攥着枪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"532002.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-532002.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-532002.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"532002.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-532002.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-532002.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-532002.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-532002.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>右耳缺了一小块的彼得，用土豆袋打过无人机的德米特里……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"532002.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-532002.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-532002.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"532002.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-532002.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-532002.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-532002.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-532002.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>歪鼻子的安德烈。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>安德烈的身体很完整，两个士兵抬着他的头和脚，像是把喝醉的他运回营帐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>只有一个血洞，在额头上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伊戈尔盯着那个伤口，可以看出熟悉的子弹形状。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-518301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-518301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-518301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔谢尼：</div><div>逃兵7人，已经按照军规处理。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>7人，对于这种惨烈程度的战役来说，不是一个令人意外的数字。对死亡的恐惧会一点点消磨掉士兵的意志，每个将领都知道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伊戈尔感到心里空空地震动了一下，就像是风吹过一把早就锈蚀的琴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-518301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-518301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-518301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔谢尼：</div><div>佩伦……突然朝我们的战线跑了过来，马也有可能是被炮声惊到了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-518301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-518301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-518301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔谢尼：</div><div>没人知道安德烈当时在想什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"532002.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-532002.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-532002.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"532002.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-532002.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-532002.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-532002.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-532002.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>我知道了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伊戈尔拍了拍阿尔谢尼的肩，继续朝前线走去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>震动没有发出声音，风就像没有来过。是的，这种事以前发生过很多次，以后也会发生，而他的心永远坚如磐石。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他的脚下是红色的河流，头顶是枪弹的暴雨。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但在这一切之外，他又听到了那首歌，轻柔地，在嘶哑的喉咙里唱起：</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军官们：</div><div><i>“哥萨克死前苦苦哀求，请给他堆一座高高的坟头。”</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军官们：</div><div><i>“让坟头也像那故乡的土地，长出鲜艳的红绣球。”</i></div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "风暴前夜-04"}}